# Qoder Sonus — findings by Inkling 2 Small

- Source: Qoder (Alibaba) (`qoder-sonus`)
- Date: 2026-11-10 (UTC) — deep second pass 2026-11-10
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Sonus (`Sonus (/ˈsoʊnəs/)`) — Qoder's 3.2x billing flagship, later recalibrated to 8x (2026-09-21 rate card)
- **Short description:** Alibaba's built-in flagship model inside the Qoder family, launched 2026-09-10 — pitched for marathon-length autonomous tasks, the hardest knowledge work and serious coding, "at its best when using your computer" (Computer Use specialty, Qoder Desktop 0.2.3+). Identity/architecture officially undisclosed; community suspects GPT-6-class/Fable-class routing behind the alias.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder International (app), Qoder IDE, Qoder CLI, JetBrains plugin, QoderWake, Cloud Agents, Mobile — built-in for all account tiers (personal and enterprise). Individual/Enterprise full lineup.
- **Release / knowledge:** launched 2026-09-10; a sibling route `Cantus` launched the same wave; "SOTA Daily Reset" and 2000-credit "Limited Time SOTA" promos ran Sept 15–19, 2026 (500/day → 1000/day); 3.2x → 8x reference-factor update effective 2026-09-21.
- **IDs:** `sonus` (Qoder built-in catalog); no upstream API ID exposed; `cantus` is the sister built-in (3.2x → 4x).
- **Context window:** not published officially (community reports "marathon-length" and "large-context" usage; unquantified).
- **Modalities:** text in → text out (Computer Use operates the desktop pro software); reasoning yes (Thinking Intensity, max settings observed); tool/agentic capabilities yes (driven by Qoder Desktop).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** charged in Qoder Credits, reference factor **8x** (was 3.2x on launch, bumped 2026-09-21) for both personal and enterprise — the most expensive multiplier in the Qoder catalog (≈5.7x Kimi-K3's 1.4x, ≈16x Qwen3.8-Max's 0.5x; Qwen3.8-Max 0.5x, GLM-5.3 0.8x, Kimi-K3 1.4x per the official notice). No per-token price exists; no free tier exists (marketing "SOTA" promos granted temporary free credits only, Sept 15–19 + 2,000-credit gifts).
- **Architecture:** undisclosed; Qoder built-in (routing-name model, no open weights).

### Raw benchmarks found

ZERO verified public benchmark scores found for this exact model/ID — no SWE-bench / LiveCodeBench / τ-Bench / GPQA rows published anywhere (official or third party). Its sibling Qoduck and stealth peers (Iceman, Crouton Alpha Free) show the same pattern on this platform.

