- no verified public score found. Official positioning: "Computer Use"-class agentic desktop automation (drives Qoder Desktop 0.2.3+, pro software, spreadsheets, research, coding); user complaints of burning 400–4000+ credits per task (avg > 1,000 Credits per heavy task) — cost, not quality evidence.

